{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>He that is born in your house must be circumcised.</b> Here He repeated it for him and did not say 'eight days,' to teach you that there is a homeborn servant circumcised after eight days (<small>variant:</small> on one day), as is explained in tractate Shabbat (137b)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {0 "The variant reading לְאֶחָד ('on one day') likely reflects a textual confusion; the printed Vilna edition reads לְאַחַר שְׁמוֹנָה יָמִים ('after eight days'). I render both readings as given."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:02.118733090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}